{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/3f62597fa025e84cd68fd3492ed54e76.avif?t=1769790121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras_big/3f62597fa025e84cd68fd3492ed54e76.avif?t=1769790121 width=1560 height=948 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to live on an airship? Now you have to. The serene skies of Elysium are both beautiful and deadly. Custom build floating fortresses, recruit your crew, and fight land and skyborne mechanisms in a paradise, filled with secrets, that wants you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 6 players in online co-op</strong>. Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where soul-powered clockwork beasts lurk in every corner. Gather resources, craft tools and airships, and survive across fractured biomes filled with danger and discovery.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airship isn\u2019t just a base or transportation, it\u2019s your home, your workshop, and your war machine. <strong>Customize every part</strong>, expand your fleet, and upgrade weapons to survive and explore the Elysian skies. From lumbering fortresses to nimble raiders, your design is the difference between glory and being scrap wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies of Elysium aren\u2019t empty. <strong>Face the Heron faction</strong>, swarms of flying mechanical monsters, hostile towers, and an armada of airships bent on your destruction. Level up, unlock new abilities, and craft gear and parts to grow from a fragile skiff into a floating fortress for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/18ceb0527cf4e2ba4f564d7bd204c750.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Loric Games, we are a small but passionate team of 17 creating  immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/601799575cddf32f7612cdbfd3b86a5a.webp?t=1769790121\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2644050?t=1769790121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/019464fe5e634c97fee4abbedd1ee32449ac3174/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769790121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/620530ecf561fde8bc2f302101dd03cd3ead5e6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769790121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/620530ecf561fde8bc2f302101dd03cd3ead5e6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769790121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>EARLY ACCESS REPORT CARD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We want to be fully transparent about where Echoes of Elysium is today, which is why we openly share how each core system is progressing, in our eyes, as we build toward our full vision. Early Access is for players who enjoy being part of that journey, seeing systems evolve, and helping shape what comes next. If you typically prefer fully-polished, feature-complete experiences, we humbly recommend waiting a bit longer before jumping in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/9d2cb8707030792658c5628032350d47.avif?t=1769790121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras_big/9d2cb8707030792658c5628032350d47.avif?t=1769790121 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/e72cf6a506a68d4fde83977e65b386eb.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/3f62597fa025e84cd68fd3492ed54e76.avif?t=1769790121\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras_big/3f62597fa025e84cd68fd3492ed54e76.avif?t=1769790121 width=1560 height=948 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to live on an airship? Now you have to. The serene skies of Elysium are both beautiful and deadly. Custom build floating fortresses, recruit your crew, and fight land and skyborne mechanisms in a paradise, filled with secrets, that wants you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/b211cbbe5aa6df5910ba817c3c36016d.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 6 players in online co-op</strong>. Uncover the mysteries of a forgotten paradise where soul-powered clockwork beasts lurk in every corner. Gather resources, craft tools and airships, and survive across fractured biomes filled with danger and discovery.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/07e0a9a676362de1cade038431bf6a73.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your airship isn\u2019t just a base or transportation, it\u2019s your home, your workshop, and your war machine. <strong>Customize every part</strong>, expand your fleet, and upgrade weapons to survive and explore the Elysian skies. From lumbering fortresses to nimble raiders, your design is the difference between glory and being scrap wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.poster.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/cd31bfb7c42e443aed794b9456fc9cd0.webm?t=1769790121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies of Elysium aren\u2019t empty. <strong>Face the Heron faction</strong>, swarms of flying mechanical monsters, hostile towers, and an armada of airships bent on your destruction. Level up, unlock new abilities, and craft gear and parts to grow from a fragile skiff into a floating fortress for you and your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/18ceb0527cf4e2ba4f564d7bd204c750.avif?t=1769790121\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Loric Games, we are a small but passionate team of 17 creating  immersive co-op RPG experiences that captivate audiences worldwide. Headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, we're committed to pushing the boundaries of innovation and storytelling in the gaming industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/extras/601799575cddf32f7612cdbfd3b86a5a.webp?t=1769790121\" width=800 height=53 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Loric Games, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/f74fb4b50047b888077d8ff75e3c81de92a080b3/header.jpg?t=1769790121","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2644050/1978516913/f498559e38b72a2494a61498d2445eda3633f468/1769541909/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769543271","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2644050/1978516913/f498559e38b72a2494a61498d2445eda3633f468/1769541909/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769543271","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2644050/1978516913/f498559e38b72a2494a61498d2445eda3633f468/17695