?t=1769790121","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/a0f8409e993df8762850d53a22f6b2611ad0e806/ss_a0f8409e993df8762850d53a22f6b2611ad0e806.600x338.jpg?t=1769790121"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/b60e166395de65f6478f52cd89947dab5d0e4047/ss_b60e166395de65f6478f52cd89947dab5d0e4047.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769790121","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644050/b60e166395de65f6478f52cd89947dab5d0e4047/ss_b60e166395de65f6478f52cd89947dab5d0e4047.600x338.jpg?t=1769790121"}],"short_description":"Survive the skies in Echoes of Elysium, a co-op airship survival RPG. Build and customize your floating fortress, gather resources, and explore a vast procedural clockwork world with up to 6 friends. Battle land and skyborne threats while uncovering mysteries in a paradise on the brink.","steam_appid":2644050,"support_info":{"email":"support@loricgames.com","url":"https://www.loricgames.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.echoes.games"}